.420\nI, I know there's been so much speculation for so long about this case,\n\n00:01:01.421 --> 00:01:02.380\nbut, I mean,\n\n00:01:02.381 --> 00:01:03.380\nthe evidence is there.\n\n00:01:03.381 --> 00:01:06.740\nI am not surprised at all whatsoever that her lawyer waved it.\n\n00:01:06.741 --> 00:01:08.420\nI think it's a strategic move,\n\n00:01:08.421 --> 00:01:11.980\nand I think they wanna, they want Things to kind of go in her favor,\n\n00:01:11.981 --> 00:01:14.180\nwhich I really, really don't think it's gonna happen,\n\n00:01:14.181 --> 00:01:15.980\nbut let me know what do you guys think about this?\n\n00:01:15.981 --> 00:01:17.500\nI'll keep you guys updated.\n\n00:01:17.501 --> 00:01:18.580\nDon't forget to like my video.\n\n00:01:18.581 --> 00:01:20.582\nShare it. Follow me for more true crime story time and\n"
